{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00955","headline":"横吹曲辞 出塞曲 · 刘济","name":"横吹曲辞 出塞曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军在重围，音信绝不通。\n羽书如流星，飞人甘泉宫。\n倚是幷州儿，少年心胆雄。\n一朝随召募，百战争王公。\n去年桑乾北，今年桑乾东。\n死是征人死，功是将军功。\n汗马牧秋月，疲兵卧霜风。\n仍闻左贤王，更欲图云中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}